<title>UK: Clinton arrives for London visit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives for London visit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton arrived in London on Thursday for a one-day visit and talks with Britain's new Labour Prime Minister Tony Blair.</p>
<p>He flew into London's Heathrow Airport from the Netherlands and headed straight to Blair's Downing Street residence where he is to address the British cabinet.</p>
</text>
